# A scissor lift stage: two equal bars pinned at their middles, feet on a level floor line.
construction line floor from -10,0 to 130,0 fixed
fix floor.end
line bara from 0,0 to 100,60 length 116.6
line barb from 100,0 to 0,60 length 116.6
point pin at 50,30
midpoint pin of bara
midpoint pin of barb
on bara.start floor
on barb.start floor
fix bara.start
